I'll build a vocabulary deck (Spanish to English) with a progress bar starting at 0 of 10 reviewed.

<a2ui-json>
[
  {
    "version": "v0.9",
    "createSurface": {
      "surfaceId": "vocab-flashcards",
      "catalogId": "https://a2uicatalog.ai/catalog/c-learning.json"
    }
  },
  {
    "version": "v0.9",
    "updateComponents": {
      "surfaceId": "vocab-flashcards",
      "components": [
        {
          "id": "root",
          "component": "columns",
          "cols": 2,
          "gap": "2rem",
          "align": "top",
          "items": [
            {
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "id": "deck-header",
                  "component": "page_header",
                  "title": "Vocabulary Flashcards",
                  "subtitle": "Flip each card to reveal the English meaning.",
                  "tag": "Spanish",
                  "accent": "#4f46e5"
                },
                {
                  "id": "review-progress",
                  "component": "progress_bar",
                  "value": 0,
                  "label": "Cards reviewed",
                  "accent": "#4f46e5",
                  "show_percent": "true",
                  "caption": "0 of 10 reviewed"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "id": "vocab-deck",
                  "component": "flashcard_deck",
                  "cards": [
                    { "front": "casa", "back": "house" },
                    { "front": "perro", "back": "dog" },
                    { "front": "libro", "back": "book" },
                    { "front": "agua", "back": "water" },
                    { "front": "comer", "back": "to eat" },
                    { "front": "grande", "back": "big" },
                    { "front": "feliz", "back": "happy" },
                    { "front": "amigo", "back": "friend" },
                    { "front": "ciudad", "back": "city" },
                    { "front": "tiempo", "back": "time / weather" }
                  ],
                  "accent": "#4f46e5",
                  "label_front": "SPANISH",
                  "label_back": "ENGLISH"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  }
]
</a2ui-json>

The deck has ten cards, each flipping to show its English meaning. The progress bar sits beside it and starts at 0 of 10. The catalog has no per-card review tracking, so the progress value will need to be updated from the data model or a new message as the learner goes through the cards.
